                },
                "message": "🐛 Make sp-litnotes-meta-fill-all converge on re-run\n\n- Compare person names without accents and case, so André/Andre is no change\n- Do not plan bib-parent when the crossref has no note and no BibTeX entry; list it\n- Find notes whose key holds a colon\n- A failing line no longer loses the other lines; failures are listed in the report\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9KR7XnCfG9uwLXz4k",
